WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.540
Lord Sei...

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:50.040
No one else will become King
having experienced such hardship.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.370
And so... I am certain...

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:01.000
You will be a greater King than anyone else.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:01.950
Shi Ka!

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:05.830
Dammit... dammit!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.830
Lord Sei... your face...

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:19.330
Your demons have left you!

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.160
Your eyes--they're so...

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.370
...beautiful...

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:33.870
Shi Kaaa!

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.040
After Shi Ka breathed her last and
I had crossed the border into Chin

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.790
with Shou Bun Kun and his soldiers,

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.660
a sharp pain ran through my left hand.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.370
Pain had returned to me.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:59.620
And not only pain, but taste,
smell--all my senses.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:05.120
The human body is a mysterious thing.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.790
I have never spoken of Shi Ka before.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.620
I thought I never would.

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.540
Then... why now?

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:31.080
Something may be changing within me once more.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.490
"Shattered Love"

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.620
Shi Ka's story was just so shocking.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.000
How hard it must have been on His Highness,

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.250
someone so special dying
right before his eyes...

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.700
'Morning, Kou!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.370
Oh, You... good morning.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.870
Have you just come from His Highness's chamber?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.200
What's wrong, Kou? You seem down.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.910
Huh? No, not at all.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:28.910
It's just...

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:33.450
Oh, I see.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.700
Let me guess: His Highness hates you now?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.790
Come on, Kou... what is it, really?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.830
I'm sorry, You. I don't want to worry you.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.700
I'm all right now.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:53.830
After all, I have you, right?

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.040
Uh-huh!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.870
You?

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:01.870
Hmm?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.080
I...

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:09.250
I can't say that I love His Highness.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.910
After hearing about Shi Ka,

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:21.910
how could I confess
my love for him so hastily?

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:25.200
Kou...

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.290
I... want to help His Highness
in whatever small way I can.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.410
That's all.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:42.870
She really <i>does</i> love him, doesn't she...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.870
Man, will you get a load of this?!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.000
In the fifth year of the
future emperor of Chin's reign,

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.250
the Kingdom of Chin dispatched
an army of over 200 thousand

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.950
to conquer the area around
Sanyou in the Kingdom of Gi.

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:11.120
This key military and transport
region was to be taken over

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.120
and annexed to Chin.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:20.790
The commanding general
assigned to this grand operation

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.330
was the famed Haku Rou of Chin:
General Mou Gou.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:30.720
"Mou Gou: Commanding 
general of the Chin army"

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.330
Don't get too worked up--that's how you get hurt.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:36.660
General Mou Gou divided the troops into three,

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:40.910
to be led by himself and by his two lieutenants.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:46.830
These three armies would
carry out a coordinated invasion.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:08:01.160
Shin and his Hi Shin Unit
were at the front of the main army,

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.370
led by General Mou Gou himself.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.160
That's Mou Gou for you!

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:13.000
Now <i>he</i> knows the true power
of the Hi Shin Unit!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.160
We had some pretty crazy
campaigns along the way, though...

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:19.540
All those piecemeal victories paid off!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:20.540
Yeah!

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.790
Here comes the cavalry!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.660
Clear the way!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.450
Hey--you!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.450
Ou Hon!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:47.200
They certainly are a lucky bunch
to have made it up to the main ranks,

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.000
aren't they, sir?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:54.500
Why, these peons will be
bragging about this feat for years!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.450
That old man really pushes my buttons...

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.830
Commander of the Hi Shin Unit...

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.290
I shall give you yet another piece of advice.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:12.830
The upcoming battle is greater than
the skirmishes you've fought so far,

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:16.750
greater even than the battle
with Sho two years ago.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.160
A real, honest-to-goodness war.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:25.450
An ant who flexes his muscles out
<i>there</i> will soon be trampled.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:29.080
That goes for your soldiers as well.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.580
Be careful.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:33.830
Got that?

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.870
Now then... shall we?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.200
Thanks for the tip.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:50.000
Lemme give you one in return...

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:58.120
The biggest wins in this campaign
will be won by the Hi Shin Unit!

00:09:58.120 --> 00:10:01.950
Then we'll be ranked higher than you guys,

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.700
and we'll work <i>you</i> like ants!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.700
So prepare yourselves!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.450
Know who's gonna be one of
the world's greatest generals?

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:10.830
<i>Me</i> , that's who!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:17.250
That's right!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.250
Yeah!

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:19.790
You said it!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:32.660
This battle'll propel me
right down that path to general!

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.620
Wait for me, Sei!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:51.160
Your Highness has gone in person
to request assistance,

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:54.290
so why has the Inner Palace made no response?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:11:00.660
One cannot know what
the Queen Dowager is thinking.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:06.080
Just as Shou Bun Kun feared,
she may well be poison...

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.910
Shi Shi, you were the one so
eager to change the balance of power

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.080
in one fell swoop.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:15.660
Perhaps you have misjudged this!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.120
Enough!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.410
It's absurd to blame Shi Shi at this late hour.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.160
While we stand idly by, it is an indisputable fact

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.450
that the gap in power between
us and Ryo Fui is only increasing.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:32.080
It is with this knowledge that
His Highness went to see his mother.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.250
All we can do now is wait.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:47.370
The heads of the houses of
Ryou, Han, and Kai have arrived!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:51.790
They seek an audience with the King.
What shall I do?

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.160
What?!

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.580
The houses of Ryou, Han, and Kai?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.790
The heads of the three royal families

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.660
behind the power of the Inner Palace...

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:13.410
And they've all come
seeking a royal audience, which means...

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:20.200
The Inner Palace has taken our side!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:25.750
This is big! With the Inner Palace as our ally,

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.450
Ryo Fui can't touch us!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:33.700
And what's more, knowing
the Inner Palace has joined us

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:37.870
might persuade him to join our camp as well.

00:12:37.870 --> 00:12:41.450
The power map of the Imperial Court
could be entirely rewritten!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:45.250
I will permit an audience!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.330
Show the heads of the three royal families in!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:56.000
"Queen Dowager"

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:04.870
It sure has gotten late!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.700
It's so dark... and so scary...

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:32.120
And I have to go <i>back</i> through
that pitch-black hallway?

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.500
No way no way no way!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.330
The moon always seems
to shine even more beautifully

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.040
when you look up at it
from the depths of suffering.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.660
Almost as though it's laughing at you.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:59.250
But then someone showed me
that wasn't how it was at all.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:07.000
"The moon shines brighter than usual

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.620
to cheer you up--and onward."

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.500
Is someone... there?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.120
The Queen Dowager!

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.500
What's she doing here?

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.370
Right this way.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.290
She's not alone!

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.790
Minister Ryo?! Wh-What can this mean?

00:14:55.540 --> 00:15:03.370
Are you sure about this?
There's no turning back, Minister Ryo.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.830
If I'm discovered, my head will roll.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.040
And having come all the way
into the Inner Palace,

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.540
clearly I have no intention of turning back.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.830
Now, what I wonder...

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:20.290
...is whether <i>you</i> are prepared, madam.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:24.120
For the power of the Inner Palace you control

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:27.330
to be aligned with me, Ryo Fui...

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:32.540
It is a hostile act against your son, the King!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.870
D-Did he just say the
power of the Inner Palace...

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.910
...would align with Minister Ryo?

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:48.660
Why isn't she on His Highness's side?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.750
The Queen Dowager is his mother, after all!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:16:01.160
You needn't give Sei another thought.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:05.700
As it happens, I met with him the other day.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.410
Just as a little test, mind you...

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:13.160
to see if a single spark of
maternal feelings was alight within me.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.410
Ah...

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.910
But, just as I thought: nothing.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.040
His face, his words...

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:26.370
I felt not a single thing.

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:28.290
No!

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.500
Whatever happens to Sei...

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:36.450
...is no business of mine.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:41.410
That's her own flesh and
blood she's talking about!

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.370
I thought it strange when I heard

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:54.870
the heads of the three royal families,

00:16:54.870 --> 00:17:00.500
usually so averse to the spotlight,
had come to see the King.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:07.750
So all of this commotion was
trying to lure me to the Inner Palace?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:16.250
I have cursed no man more than you.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:19.290
Hated no man more than you.

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:21.120
And yet, somehow,

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:27.620
no man excites me more than you.

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:39.450
This, too, may change.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:46.330
Seventeen years ago, when we
met in Kantan, the capital of Sho,

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.500
this woman truly sparkled.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:55.410
So many people gathered even from distant towns

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.330
just to catch a glimpse of her as she danced.

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:04.580
This peerless beauty,
brimming with innocence and grace,

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:09.660
was beloved by all,
praised as the Jewel of Kantan.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.750
Now she is but a shadow
of her former self.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.540
Was it all my doing?

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.290
Jewel of Kantan...

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:35.500
Never say that name again!

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:44.410
Seventeen years ago,
I was at the very height of happiness

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.080
Because of a man named Ryo Fui,

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:54.700
with whom I exchanged heartfelt promises

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:57.870
to love and accompany for a lifetime.

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:07.160
I never had any doubt that my
future would be anything but happy.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:14.330
But one day, you brought me
to meet a royal from a foreign land...

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:17.790
And you said to me--me, your intended--

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:24.160
"Jewel of Kantan, as of today,
this is the man you shall love."

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:32.330
Our love, our promise, our happiness, our future--

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:38.500
All illusions--nothing more.

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:47.620
I knew even then that you had put
all you owned into Shi So of Chin.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:53.450
You and your money drove Shi So
right into Chin's royal throne,

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:58.950
for which favor you made him
promise you the position of minister.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:08.580
You made me a tool
in your own rise to power,

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.250
Ryo Fui!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:18.200
That's exactly right. I can make no excuse.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.330
That's a relief.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:31.040
If you were the kind of man
who'd make excuses <i>now</i> ,

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:35.250
I'd have to give you up as well.

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:42.200
The joke is on the King's faction, then.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:45.870
They truly believe they've brought
the power of the Inner Palace

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.580
onto their side...

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:59.540
You have the chance--
Why not stamp them out?

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:05.950
Then, you and I,
those lovers from seventeen years ago,

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.620
can take over that foreign land of Chin

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.620
and get that happy ending after all.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:30.410
The Queen Dowager and Minister Ryo...
were once lovers?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.700
I don't quite understand, but...

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:35.160
...I have the feeling...

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:39.250
...something dreadful is about to happen.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.830
I've got to tell His Highness!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:04.200
I've got to... tell His Highness...

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:36.410
My turn for morning clean-up again, huh?

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:42.870
There!

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:52.000
What--

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:58.790
Ko--Kou!

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:01.410
Kou?! Kou!

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:05.830
Blood...

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:09.200
Kou! Stay with me, Kou!

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:14.290
Kou... Kou! Kou? Kooou!

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.950
Somebody? Anybody! Please!

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:18.790
Kooou!

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Lineup"
